("look at top card of library (any time / activated) / play from top", r"look at the top card of (your|target player's|that player's|each player's) library|top card of your library (any time|is revealed)|play (lands|cards|the top card) from the top|cast spells from the top", "Look at / reveal top card of a library as an activated or triggered effect, and playing from the top."),
("put card from hand on top/bottom of library", r"(put|puts) (a|one|two|that|those|the) (card|cards)[^.]* from (your|their) hand on (top|the bottom)|put (a card|cards) from your hand on|put the rest back|put it back on top|on top of (their|your) library in any order", "Putting a card from hand onto the library, or putting looked-at cards back on top in chosen order beyond 'look at top N'."),
("put permanent into library (choice top/bottom, Nth from top)", r"on their choice of the top or bottom|(second|third) from the top|into (its|their) owner's library|shuffles? (it|that card|target \w+|them) into (its|their) owner's library|shuffles? [^.]*into (their|its owner's|his or her) library|owner shuffles it", "Tuck effects: owner puts it on top or bottom of their choice, Nth from top, shuffle into library."),
("exile top card(s) of library; may play them until end of (next) turn (impulse draw)", r"you may (play|cast) (that card|those cards|it|them|the exiled card|cards exiled)|until the end of your next turn, you may play|exile the top (\w+ )?cards? of (your|their|target player's|each player's|that player's) library", "Impulse draw: exile from top of library with permission to play it for a duration (CR 611.2c-style permission)."),
("shuffle / search with name or 'cards named' (Squadron Hawk etc.)", r"cards? named ~|named ~ in|card named", "Effects that reference cards by name ('search for cards named ~', 'cards named ~ in all graveyards')."),
("search library variants (to battlefield/hand split, by mv, for any card, opponent's library)", r"search (your|their|target (player|opponent)'s|that player's|its controller's) library for [^.]*(onto the battlefield and the other|put (one|two)|with mana value|card with mana value|a card and|any number|named|that shares|of the chosen|creature card with power|permanent card|instant|sorcery|artifact card|enchantment card|equipment|aura|land card(s)? with)", "Library searches not covered by 'search <filter> card to hand/battlefield': mana-value filters, split destinations (Kodama's Reach), opponents' libraries."),
("you may shuffle / then shuffle (standalone)", r"^(you may shuffle|then shuffle|shuffle your library)", "Standalone shuffle clauses (Ponder)."),
("mill variants (may mill, mill until, mill X, return from milled)", r"you may mill|mills? cards? until|mill (half|that many|x)|cards? milled this way|milled this way", "Milling variants: optional mill, mill X, mill-until, effects on the milled cards."),
("draw variants (draw X where X = count, opponents draw, draw then put back)", r"draws? (cards )?equal to|draws? a card for each|draw (two|three) cards, then (put|discard (two|a card unless))|draw cards equal|each player draws", "Draw counted by quantities not supported, symmetrical draw, draw-then-put-back."),
# ---------- graveyard ----------
("return this from graveyard (triggered/activated, not via exile cost)", r"return (this card|~|it) from your graveyard to (your hand|the battlefield)|return (this card|~) to (your hand|the battlefield) from your graveyard|may return (this card|~) from your graveyard", "Triggered/activated graveyard-recursion of the card itself (e.g. 'whenever you cast a multicolored spell, you may return ~ from your graveyard to your hand'; '{2}{B}: return this card from your graveyard to your hand' without exile-cost)."),
("exile target player's graveyard / cards from a single graveyard", r"exile (target player's|each opponent's|that player's|all cards from target player's) graveyard|from a single graveyard|exile all cards from (all )?graveyards|exile (all|each) (creature )?cards? (from|in) (all )?graveyards|exile up to (\w+) target cards from|exile (up to )?(\w+ )?target cards? from (a|an opponent's) graveyard", "Graveyard hate beyond 'exile target card from a graveyard': whole graveyards, 'up to N target cards from a single graveyard'."),
("return creature card with mana value N or less / with characteristic", r"return target (creature|permanent|artifact|nonland permanent) card with (mana value|power|toughness)|card with mana value \w+ or less from (your|a) graveyard", "Graveyard targets filtered by mana value/power (reanimation of small creatures)."),
("put target card from graveyard on top/bottom of library", r"(card|cards) from (your|a|target player's|an opponent's) graveyard (on top|on the bottom|into (its owner's|your) library)|put [^.]*from your graveyard on (top|the bottom)", "Graveyard-to-library effects."),
("graveyard count conditions (N or more cards / card types / creature cards in graveyard)", r"as long as there are \w+ or more [^.]*in your graveyard|activate only if there are|if there are \w+ or more [^.]*cards? in your graveyard|for each [^.]*card in your graveyard|number of [^.]*cards? in your graveyard|(instant|sorcery|creature|permanent|land|artifact) cards? in your graveyard", "Counts and thresholds of specific card types in a graveyard (beyond threshold/delirium shorthands)."),
