("token with granted quoted ability (Eldrazi Scion/Spawn mana tokens etc.)", r"(it|they|token|tokens) (has|have|with) \"", "Tokens defined with a quoted ability ('1/1 Eldrazi Scion with \"Sacrifice this token: Add {C}.\"') -- token definitions exist, check the quoted-ability rendering in create."),
